================================================================================
technology9-game
================================================================================

KEYBINDINGS
-----------

Q          - cycle mouse grab mode & fullscreen game
Esc        - quit
LClick     - interact
RClick     - focus
T          - toggle flashlight
Mouse      - rotational movement
W, A, S, D - translational movement
LShift     - sprint
LCtrl      - crouch
+          - increase look sense
-          - lower look sense
Y          - toggle noclip

BUILDING
--------

Run
	$ cargo +nightly build --release

The exe will be in ./target/release

RUNNING
-------

Double click the ./game.exe

Or, run
	$ ./backrooms_liminal.exe -- <seed>

